    "description": "<div class=\"powr-chat\" id=\"fa409859_1652894558\"></div>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino; font-size: medium; color: #808080;\"><strong>VITAMIN mineral soak: kick those cold and flu symptoms with an antioxidant rich blend in relaxing Pacific sea salts.</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino; font-size: small; color: #808080;\"><strong> 1lb 2oz / 510 g</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino; font-size: small; color: #808080;\"><strong>Ingredients: Pacific Sea Salt, Ascorbic Acid (Vitamin C), Citrus Limon (Lemon) Essential Oil, Eucalyptus Globulus (Eucalyptus) Essential Oil, Melaleuca Alternifolia (Tea Tree) Essential Oil, Rosa Canina (Rose Hips) Powder, Hibiscus Sabdariffa (Hibiscus) Petal Powder, Echinacea Purpurea (Echinacea) Root Powder, Eleutherococcus Senticosus (Ginseng) Root Powder. </strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino; font-size: small; color: #808080;\"><strong>Add 1-2 large handfuls to a warm bath and soak for 20 minutes.&nbsp;</strong></span></p>",
